# ATLAS code owners.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# READ THIS FIRST: this file does NOT restrict who can change what.
#
# Anyone on the team can contribute to any part of this codebase. CODEOWNERS
# only auto-requests a reviewer so changes reach someone with context — it is a
# COORDINATION tool, not a permission system.
#
# "Require review from Code Owners" is deliberately NOT enabled on main. Any
# teammate's approval satisfies branch protection. If you want to improve the
# ML pipeline, the map, the audit chain or the docs, open a PR — you do not
# need to own the area.
#
# The exception is judgement, not permission: for the sensitive paths at the
# bottom, please wait for the listed reviewer rather than merging on the first
# approval you get. Those are the areas where a subtle mistake is expensive and
# hard to detect later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

